<p id=3D"mwCQ"><b id=3D"mwCg">William King-Noel, 1st Earl of Lovelace</b>, =
<span class=3D"nobold noexcerpt nowraplinks" style=3D"font-size:;" about=3D=
"#mwt12" typeof=3D"mw:Transclusion" id=3D"mwCw" data-mw=3D"{&quot;parts&quo=
