t;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;FRS&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><span style=3D"fo=
nt-size: 85%;"><a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki=
/Fellow_of_the_Royal_Society" title=3D"Fellow of the Royal Society">FRS</a>=
</span></span> (21 February 1805 =E2=80=93 29 December 1893), styled <b id=
=3D"mwDA">The Lord King</b> from 1833 to 1838, was an English nobleman and =
scientist. He was the husband of <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.=
wikipedia.org/wiki/Lord_Byron" title=3D"Lord Byron" id=3D"mwDQ">Lord Byron<=
/a>'s daughter <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki=
/Ada_Lovelace" title=3D"Ada Lovelace" id=3D"mwDg">Ada</a>, today remembered=
 as a pioneering <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wi=
ki/Computer" title=3D"Computer" id=3D"mwDw">computer</a> scientist.</p>

<meta property=3D"mw:PageProp/toc" id=3D"mwEA" data-mw=3D"{&quot;autoGenera=
ted&quot;:true}"></section><section data-mw-section-id=3D"1" id=3D"mwEQ" ar=
ia-labelledby=3D"Early_life"><div class=3D"mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id=
=3D"Early_life">Early life</h2><span class=3D"mw-editsection"><span class=
=3D"mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/i=
