amp;section=3D1" title=3D"Edit section: Early life"><span>edit</span></a><s=
pan class=3D"mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id=3D"mwEg">Lovelace was the eldest son of <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=
=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peter_King,_7th_Baron_King" title=3D"Pete=
r King, 7th Baron King" id=3D"mwEw">Peter King, 7th Baron King</a>, and his=
 wife, Lady Hester Fortescue, granddaughter of <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=
=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/George_Grenville" title=3D"George Grenvil=
le" id=3D"mwFA">George Grenville</a>. The politician the Hon. <a rel=3D"mw:=
WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peter_John_Locke_King" titl=
e=3D"Peter John Locke King" class=3D"mw-redirect" id=3D"mwFQ">Peter John Lo=
cke King</a> was his younger brother.</p>

<p id=3D"mwFg">Educated at <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipe=
dia.org/wiki/Eton_College" title=3D"Eton College" id=3D"mwFw">Eton College<=
/a> and <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trinit=
y_College,_Cambridge" title=3D"Trinity College, Cambridge" id=3D"mwGA">Trin=
ity College, Cambridge</a>, he entered the diplomatic service and became se=
cretary to Lord Nugent. He succeeded in the barony in 1833 when his father =
died.<sup about=3D"#mwt15" class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-1" rel=
=3D"dc:references" typeof=3D"mw:Extension/ref" data-mw=3D"{&quot;name&quot;=
:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quo=
t;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1&quot;}}"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.or=
g/wiki/William_King-Noel,_1st_Earl_of_Lovelace#cite_note-1" id=3D"mwGQ"><sp=
an class=3D"mw-reflink-text" id=3D"mwGg"><span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D=
"mwGw">[</span>1<span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwHA">]</span></span></a=
></sup> He performed architectural work in his houses.<sup about=3D"#mwt18"=
 class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-2" rel=3D"dc:references" typeof=
=3D"mw:Extension/ref" data-mw=3D"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;at=
trs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_=
note-2&quot;}}"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_King-Noel,=
_1st_Earl_of_Lovelace#cite_note-2" id=3D"mwHQ"><span class=3D"mw-reflink-te=
xt" id=3D"mwHg"><span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwHw">[</span>2<span cla=
ss=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwIA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

