ction=3D4" title=3D"Edit section: Second marriage"><span>edit</span></a><sp=
an class=3D"mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id=3D"mwVA">In 1865 he remarried, to the widow Jane Crawford Jenkins. Th=
ey had one child, Lionel (1865=E2=80=931929), who would eventually succeed =
as 3rd Earl of Lovelace in 1906. </p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id=3D"5" id=3D"mwVQ" aria-labelledby=3D"=
