rl of Lovelace" id=3D"mwgg">Ralph</a>, who was already the 13th Baron Wentw=
orth. The first Earl of Lovelace was buried in his mausoleum in the churchy=
ard of Martin's Church, <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia=
.org/wiki/East_Horsley" title=3D"East Horsley" id=3D"mwgw">East Horsley</a>=
, which still contains his tomb and that of his second wife.<sup about=3D"#=
